ization as an addition to, rather than a replacement for, conventional optimization.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-b92b13361722074e4c62b8a70db5da145a188c4637c50e8a5f99ff530615b0af\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"similar:claim-execution-profiles-integrated-into-an-optimizing-c-compiler-can-guide-classic-op--20be52b7603e|claim-profile-based-classic-optimizations-are-intended-to-complement-conventional-opti--6bcefbcf9607\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"similar\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-execution-profiles-integrated-into-an-optimizing-c-compiler-can-guide-classic-op--20be52b7603e\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"10\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-unpurified-strands-can-build-complex-circuits--367a566abb69\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"2\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"Calibrated thresholds explain how unpurified components can still produce desired gate behavior.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-60fe9a35e9ae173268da36b9c4d42538acbfdaf2f9f27550735a50c7f6b63396\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-effective-concentration-calibration-guides-thresholds--367a566abb69->claim-unpurified-strands-can-build-complex-circuits--367a566abb69\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-effective-concentration-calibration-guides-thresholds--367a566abb69\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"3\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-in-the-worst-case-topology-the-entanglement-swapping-based-strategy-has-per-laye--bd58d42b2d90\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"6\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"The validation table reports that the analytical upper bounds hold across the evaluated benchmark circuits.\",\n      \"relati