es another measured component in the combined matmult WCET reduction.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-3a3a4c51597c639d2734cdf2c20ec242cd03e791b70be67789c22729704b277c\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-ilp-based-data-scratchpad-allocation-lowers-wcet-by-moving-frequently-accessed-v--8ceca90523fc->claim-the-wcc-optimizations-compose-applying-register-allocation-code-and-data-scratch--1393cb5b3616\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-ilp-based-data-scratchpad-allocation-lowers-wcet-by-moving-frequently-accessed-v--8ceca90523fc\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"8\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-machine-learning-based-compilation-can-make-compiler-optimization-more-evidence--20aeeff3a32c\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"8\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"The limits on training data and legality make empirical scrutiny necessary rather than optional.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-4f8e7ec90c7afe78ad418e3a036e537a96d0ba685651b82417f1366976d045df\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-machine-learning-based-compiler-optimization-is-limited-by-the-quality-represent--f9c7d385cc26->claim-machine-learning-based-compilation-can-make-compiler-optimization-more-evidence--20aeeff3a32c\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-machine-learning-based-compiler-optimization-is-limited-by-the-quality-represent--f9c7d385cc26\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"7\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-execution-profiles-integrated-into-an-optimizing-c-compiler-can-guide-classic-op--20be52b7603e\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"0\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"The measured benchmark speedups support the usefulness of integrating profile information into classic optimizations.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-9473b6fae4acc58fcfd6d11f8f154ab958a56c0f90edba6506a82159ba8eb894\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-on-the-benchmark-suite-profile-based-super-block-optimizations-averaged-a-1-15-s--e5d7486c0e56->claim-execution-profiles-integrated-into-an-optimizing-c-compiler-can-guide-classic-op--20be52b7603e\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-on-the-benchmark-suite-profile-based-super-block-optimizations-averaged-a-1-15-s--e5d7486c0e56\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"6\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-systematic-flow-shortens-unpurified-circuit-building--367a566abb69\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"5\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"Measured outlier gate ratios justify the procedure\\u2019s outlier-identification and adjustment step.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-c438b81fc7a40faea6f7e079c7633128aa8642965d217e3713dae5d7e9fc8aa9\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-outlier-gates-expose-synthesis-variation--367a566abb69->claim-systematic-flow-shortens-unpurified-circuit-building--367a566abb69\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-outlier-gates-expose-synthesis-variation--367a566abb69\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"4\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-the-machine-learning-compiler-workflow-separates-model-learning-from-deployment--a04ee1ab9738\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"1\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"Feature representations are required for the training stage that precedes deployment.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-55bf202bd84d28759b47f3292156a528ab67224e00c356bdfe80e8147728a44b\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-program-features-provide-the-quantifiable-representation-that-allows-learning-al--a254f7b701be->claim-the-machine-learning-compiler-workflow-separates-model-learning-from-deployment--a04ee1ab9738\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-program-features-provide-the-quantifiable-representation-that-allows-learning-al--a254f7b701be\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"2\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-distributed-quantum-compilers-must-model-temporal-coupling-map-dynamics-because--0883f72a302d\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"3\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"Bell-state consumption and communication-qubit limits are the resource dynamics that require distributed coupling maps to become temporal rather than static.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-7d39d302f792fa4b94b39ae356a3e2ad9f4916cdb61548377de1ce58954f4b18\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-remote-cnot-execution-consumes-bell-state-resources-and-is-limited-by-the-number--ff11e4d2be8e->claim-distributed-quantum-compilers-must-model-temporal-coupling-map-dynamics-because--0883f72a302d\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-remote-cnot-execution-consumes-bell-state-resources-and-is-limited-by-the-number--ff11e4d2be8e\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"2\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-unpurified-strands-can-build-complex-circuits--367a566abb69\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"2\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"The six-layer, 78-species implementation is the concrete case demonstrating complex circuits from unpurified strands.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-90e4fbc2b37f46d543636da970bae926e4496af9c522e177046455495397496f\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-rule-110-124-circuit-has-78-species--367a566abb69->claim-unpurified-strands-can-build-complex-circuits--367a566abb69\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-rule-110-124-circuit-has-78-species--367a566abb69\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"1\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-unpurified-strands-can-build-complex-circuits--367a566abb69\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"2\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"Signal restoration and tuning provide the compensatory mechanism that makes unpurified construction feasible.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-fdb133b87e68b645ed980cc1d9133580147e67840b695e45c68a0bd9ce69568a\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-signal-restoration-compensates-for-impurity--367a566abb69->claim-unpurified-strands-can-build-complex-circuits--367a566abb69\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-signal-restoration-compensates-for-impurity--367a566abb69\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"8\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-wcc-couples-a-c-compiler-to-the-ait-static-wcet-analyzer-so-that-wcet-data-is-pr--13f9763eb2a9\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"1\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"The need to optimize the WCEP explains why WCC integrates static WCET analysis into compilation.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-c79abe7deb9c0b69802aea0ab0900164e6b9a14925499b3fb19c50dad091b7fe\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-static-wcet-reduction-depends-on-optimizing-the-worst-case-execution-path-becaus--b6a70fae6e3d->claim-wcc-couples-a-c-compiler-to-the-ait-static-wcet-analyzer-so-that-wcet-data-is-pr--13f9763eb2a9\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-static-wcet-reduction-depends-on-optimizing-the-worst-case-execution-path-becaus--b6a70fae6e3d\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"0\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-full-circuit-recovers-ideal-ca-patterns--367a566abb69\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"6\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"The unpurified synthesis-error model explains why the successful full-circuit readout occurs on a slower 24-hour timescale.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-f9459f41ffe3186112b4d97543480592b8c33ec0eb02e8250509ceb33e3f0938\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-synthesis-error-model-explains-delayed-outputs--367a566abb69->claim-full-circuit-recovers-ideal-ca-patterns--367a566abb69\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-synthesis-error-model-explains-delayed-outputs--367a566abb69\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"7\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-full-circuit-recovers-ideal-ca-patterns--367a566abb69\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"6\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"The systematic build procedure leads into the full circuit implementation evaluated at 24 hours.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-8efe95a3e2acf3e99fe3f1fea4dbe3b4e48e80ab8eabc31a5bf1dcd5d3637a1e\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-systematic-flow-shortens-unpurified-circuit-building--367a566abb69->claim-full-circuit-recovers-ideal-ca-patterns--367a566abb69\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-systematic-flow-shortens-unpurified-circuit-building--367a566abb69\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"5\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-classic-scalar-optimizations-can-be-reformulated-to-operate-on-super-blocks-and--79ce55378df0\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"4\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"The operation-combining example explains why super-block scope exposes more opportunities for classic optimizations.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-d99dad5f722c0c6c8c9dd73ff7f2303d5d8b262d745c466ab8badf636bc6438d\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-tail-duplication-creates-additional-optimization-opportunities-because-it-can-ma--6c81300e0307->claim-classic-scalar-optimizations-can-be-reformulated-to-operate-on-super-blocks-and--79ce55378df0\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-tail-duplication-creates-additional-optimization-opportunities-because-it-can-ma--6c81300e0307\",\n      \"src_claim_ref\": \"5\",\n      \"status\": \"open\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"below_040_streak\": 0,\n      \"contradiction_confidence_band\": \"unknown\",\n      \"dst_claim_id\": \"claim-machine-learning-based-compilation-can-use-a-model-inside-the-compiler-to-choose--f8131a5c483d\",\n      \"dst_claim_ref\": \"0\",\n      \"last_evaluated_run_id\": null,\n      \"rationale\": \"The learning-deployment workflow explains how compiler decisions can be made by an internal learned model.\",\n      \"relation_file_id\": \"rel-679d0183214a394730311f922b080afcbdc172ff7bd1ac3f954d1ec3e3acaa7f\",\n      \"relation_id\": \"supports:claim-the-machine-learning-compiler-workflow-separates-model-learning-from-deployment--a04ee1ab9738->claim-machine-learning-based-compilation-can-use-a-model-inside-the-compiler-to-choose--f8131a5c483d\",\n      \"relation_type\": \"supports\",\n      \"src_claim_id\": \"claim-the-mac